                    "sense_definition": "An act of fellatio.",
                    "learner_level": "C2",
                    "frequency": "VeryLow",
                    "semantic_group_id": "",
                    "name_type": "no",
                    "examples": [
                        {
                            "text": "The crude joke he made about a <w>gobble</w> was highly inappropriate for the workplace.",
